    <figure class="project-figure wide"><img src="image/Art/MemoryStill/Film.jpg" alt="..."></figure>
    <p>The custom-designed film projector completes this dialogue between past and present. With double film spool driven by stepper motors, it recreates the dynamic motion from static films, allowing these fixed moments to be continuously reactivated and recontextualized, much like Hong Kong's unchanging streetscapes continue to function amid a rapidly changing world.</p>
